{"suttaId":"thig7.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[671,692],"vripara":"175"},"segments":{"thig7.1:0.3":"Uttarātherīgāthā","thig7.1:1.1":"“‘Musalāni gahetvāna, dhaññaṃ koṭṭenti māṇavā;","thig7.1:1.3":"Puttadārāni posentā, dhanaṃ vindanti māṇavā.","thig7.1:2.1":"“‘Ghaṭetha buddhasāsane, yaṃ katvā nānutappati;","thig7.1:2.3":"Khippaṃ pādāni dhovitvā, ekamantaṃ nisīdatha.","thig7.1:3.1":"“‘Cittaṃ upaṭṭhapetvāna, ekaggaṃ susamāhitaṃ;","thig7.1:3.3":"Paccavekkhatha saṅkhāre, parato no ca attato’.","thig7.1:4.1":"“Tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, paṭācārānusāsaniṃ;","thig7.1:4.3":"Pāde pakkhālayitvāna, ekamante upāvisiṃ.","thig7.1:5.1":"“Rattiyā purime yāme, pubbajātimanussariṃ;","thig7.1:5.3":"Rattiyā majjhime yāme, dibbacakkhuṃ visodhayiṃ.","thig7.1:6.1":"“Rattiyā pacchime yāme, tamokkhandhaṃ padālayiṃ;","thig7.1:6.3":"Tevijjā atha vuṭṭhāsiṃ, katā te anusāsanī.","thig7.1:7.1":"“Sakkaṃva devā tidasā, saṅgāme aparājitaṃ;","thig7.1:7.3":"Purakkhatvā vihassāmi, tevijjāmhi anāsavā”.","thig7.1:8.1":"… Uttarā therī …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
